    <listOfParameters>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="f_renal_function" name="renal function" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <blockquote>
              <p>1.0: increased kidney function
1.0: normal kidney function (healthy control)
&lt;1.0: decreased kidney function</p>
            </blockquote>
            <p>Renal function relative to the healthy glomerular filtration rate
GFR_base, which is 101 ml/min at 75 kg; a measured creatinine
clearance of X ml/min is the renal function X/101.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="GFR_base" name="glomerular filtration rate (healthy)" value="101" units="ml_per_min" constant="true"/>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="GFR" name="glomerular filtration rate" value="NaN" units="ml_per_min" constant="false"/>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="fu_riv" name="fraction unbound in plasma rivaroxaban" value="0.079" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>7.9 % unbound in the plasma of healthy subjects (Kubitza2013), 92-95 %
bound to plasma proteins, mainly albumin.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="RIVEX_f" name="renal clearance of unbound rivaroxaban relative to the GFR" value="6.39514735276726" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The renal clearance of rivaroxaban is RIVEX_f times the filtration
of its unbound fraction, fu_riv * GFR: 1 is filtration alone, above
1 a net secretion. Rivaroxaban is secreted by P-gp and BCRP, about
two thirds of the renal clearance of 2.4-3.1 l/hr are active
(Mueck2014, Kubitza2013); 36-42 % of a small oral dose are
excreted unchanged in the urine (Weinz2009, Kubitza2005a), i.e.
RIVEX_f about 6-8.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
        <distrib:listOfUncertainties>
          <distrib:uncertainty distrib:name="fit PK_20261018_075718__82026">
            <notes>
              <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
