      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000002" id="f_pgp" name="P-gp/BCRP activity" value="1" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>Activity of the renal efflux transporters (P-gp, BCRP) relative to
normal: 1.0 normal, &lt;1.0 inhibition, &gt;1.0 induction. It scales the
secretion, <code>(RIVEX_f - 1)</code>, not the filtration; set by the
experiments of the coadministrations with documented factors, not
fitted.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
      <parameter sboTerm="SBO:0000009" id="RXEX_f" name="renal clearance of the rivaroxaban metabolites relative to the GFR" value="7" units="dimensionless" constant="true">
        <notes>
          <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
            <p>The renal clearance of the metabolites is RXEX_f times the GFR; the
metabolites are about 11 % of the radioactivity in plasma after
[14C]rivaroxaban (Weinz2009), so they are cleared faster than they
are filtered.</p>
          </body>
        </notes>
      </parameter>
